aft consumption. Each occupied workbench cell loses one item, then its audited native container is returned. Shapeless matching reads occupied cells row by row, selects the first matching remaining predicate, and removes the first predicate equal to that selection; the removed instance can differ. Shaped matching tries column offsets, row offsets and then unmirrored before mirrored placement. Unused source-array tail predicates do not occupy the grid."}]}